{"id":"en_they-locked-out-the-billionaire-who-owned-the-house","title":"They Locked Out the Billionaire Who Owned the House","titleEn":"They Locked Out the Billionaire Who Owned the House","description":"Mira runs a diner, but few people know she also secretly chairs a billion-dollar company. When her son gets married, his in-laws move into her condo and take it over, eventually locking her out of her own home. Rather than accept the situation, Mira fights back: she reclaims the house and cancels the arrangements the in-laws had put in place. The story follows her effort to restore control over her property and her life. The series and its episodes can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/they-locked-out-the-billionaire-who-owned-the-house/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/they-locked-out-the-billionaire-who-owned-the-house/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Short Drama","Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcebm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_they-locked-out-the-billionaire-who-owned-the-house_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcebm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_they-locked-out-the-billionaire-who-owned-the-house_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcebm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_they-locked-out-the-billionaire-who-owned-the-house_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dcebm/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_they-locked-out-the-billionaire-who-owne